@ApiHostAddr = http://localhost:5089

### Liveness. Ingestion has no HTTP debug bypass: the only production-shaped path in
### is capture-gateway -> gRPC UploadTransactions on port 5091. Deterministic demo
### traffic enters through the feed emulator or the gateway endpoint below.
GET {{ApiHostAddr}}/health

### Readiness: required Kafka topics have usable metadata.
GET {{ApiHostAddr}}/health/ready

### gRPC contract probe without writing a client (grpcurl from mise.toml):
### grpcurl -plaintext -import-path src/Protos -proto transactions.proto \
###   localhost:5091 txmonitoring.ingestion.v1.TransactionIngestion/UploadTransactions
